# PixiJS

Use the ticker for all animations - avoid setTimeout/requestAnimationFrame.
Pre-create containers and graphics objects, then manipulate them in the ticker.
Use `pixelLine: true` for crisp geometric shapes.
Center all content using the root container pattern.
Handle window resizing gracefully by updating positions in resize handlers.
Prefer `Graphics` over sprites for geometric and procedural shapes.
Use object pooling for elements that appear/disappear frequently.
